<div class="tab-pane" id="employers">

	<div class="form-group"></div>
	<div class="alert alert-info text-center">
		<a data-toggle="modal" href="#employerScriptInstructionsModal"> <span
			class="glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"></span> Instruções de Uso do
			Script de Gestores
		</a>
	</div>

	<div class="text-center">
		<img id="employers-loader" src="../img/loader.cache.gif" />
	</div>

	<table class="table table-striped table-hover" style="display: none;"
		id="employers-table">
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th>Nome</th>
				<th>Último Acesso</th>
				<th></th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody></tbody>
	</table>

	<div class="panel-group" id="add-employer-accordion">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading">
				<a class="accordion-toggle" data-toggle="collapse"
					data-parent="#add-employer-accordion" href="#employer-collapse-one"><span
					class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus-sign"></span> Adicionar Gestor</a>
			</div>
			<div id="employer-collapse-one" class="panel-collapse collapse">
				<div class="panel-body">
					<form id="add-employer-form" class="form-inline" role="form"
						onsubmit="return false;">
						<div class="form-group">
							<label class="sr-only" for="new-employer-name">Nome</label> <input
								type="text" class="form-control" id="new-employer-name"
								placeholder="Nome">
						</div>
						<div class="form-group">
							<label class="sr-only" for="new-employer-id">ID</label> <input
								type="number" class="form-control" id="new-employer-id"
								placeholder="ID no eRepublik" required>
						</div>
						<button id="save-new-dist" class="btn btn-primary"
							onclick="addEmployer();">
							<span class="glyphicon glyphicon-floppy-disk"></span> Salvar
						</button>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="form-group"></div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="employerKeyModal" tabindex="-3"
	role="dialog" aria-hidden="true">
	<div class="modal-dialog">
		<div class="modal-content">
			<div class="modal-header">
				<button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal"
					aria-hidden="true">×</button>
				<h3>Chave de Autenticação do Gestor</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-body">
				<p>Atenção!</p>
				<p>
					A chave do gestor é necessária para autenticação do script. <strong>Nunca
						torne a chave do gestor pública!</strong>
				</p>
				<form class="form-horizontal" role="form" onsubmit="return false;">
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="employer-modal-name" class="col-lg-2 control-label">Gestor:</label>
						<div class="col-lg-10">
							<input type="text" class="form-control " id="employer-modal-name"
								placeholder="Gestor" readonly="readonly">
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="employer-modal-key" class="col-lg-2 control-label">Chave:</label>
						<div class="col-lg-10">
							<input type="text" class="form-control " id="employer-modal-key"
								placeholder="Chave">
						</div>
					</div>
				</form>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-footer">
				<button class="btn btn-primary" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="employerScriptInstructionsModal"
	tabindex="-4" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true">
	<div class="modal-dialog">
		<div class="modal-content">
			<div class="modal-header">
				<button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal"
					aria-hidden="true">×</button>
				<h3>Instruções do Script de Gestores</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-body">
				<p>O Script de Gestores permite o acompanhamento do trabalho
					diário dos jogadores cadastrados, integrando-se com a validação de
					trabalho para a distribuição.</p>
				<p>Instruções para o Gestor:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>O gestor deve ter instalado o <a
						href="https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/addon/greasemonkey/">Greasemonkey</a>
						(Firefox) ou <a
						href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/tampermonkey/dhdgffkkebhmkfjojejmpbldmpobfkfo">Tampermonkey</a>
						(Chrome)
					</li>
					<li>O gestor deve instalar o Script <a
						href="../js/dynamic/employers.user.js">por esse link</a></li>
				</ul>
				<p>Instruções para o Administrador:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Cadastre o gestor no eDist</li>
					<li>Forneça ao gestor a Chave de Autenticação</li>
					<li>Configure a verificação de trabalho nas Configurações de
						Distribuição</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-footer">
				<button class="btn btn-primary" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>